第４四半期連結会計期間では簿価切下げ額の戻入れ2,097百万円を計上し、当連結会計年度では簿価切下げ額の戻入れ2,275百万円計上(売上原価の減少)の見込みとなりました。●営業外収益(持分法による投資利益)の内容　主にフィリピンの持分法適用関連会社において、堅調な需要に支えられ、すでに計上済みの5,981百万円に加え1,893百万円計上する見込みとなり、当連結会計年度におきまして持分法による投資利益7,875百万円を計上する見込みとなりました。", null, "CurrentYearInstant"], ["売上高", "NetSales", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 9138000000, "9,138", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["営業利益", "OperatingIncome", "tse-ed-t", "予想", -6507000000, "6,507", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["経常利益", "OrdinaryIncome", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 199000000, "199", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["ProfitAttributableToOwnersOfParent", "ProfitAttributableToOwnersOfParent", "tse-ed-t", "予想", -181000000, "181", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["NetIncomePerShare", "NetIncomePerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", -10.41, "10.41", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["売上高", "NetSales", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 9414000000, "9,414", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["営業利益", "OperatingIncome", "tse-ed-t", "予想", -4971000000, "4,971", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["経常利益", "OrdinaryIncome", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 3323000000, "3,323", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["ProfitAttributableToOwnersOfParent", "ProfitAttributableToOwnersOfParent", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 2610000000, "2,610", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["NetIncomePerShare", "NetIncomePerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 146.04, "146.04", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["AmountChangeNetSales", "AmountChangeNetSales", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 276000000, "276", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"